":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-jinshu-062-zuti-ws2629226"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-jin062-zuti-father","subject_person_id":"s8t_e95_gpz","object_person_id":"y5t_2r6_3d5","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"父武"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-062","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-062-zuti","source_id":"s-jinshu-062-zuti-ws2629226","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-062-zuti:p001","quote":"祖逖，字士稚，范陽遒人也。世吏二千石，爲北州舊姓。父武，晉王掾上谷太守。逖少孤，兄弟六人。兄該、納等並開爽有才幹。逖性豁蕩，不修儀檢，年十四五猶未知書，諸兄每憂之。然輕財好俠，慷慨有節尚，每至田舍，輒稱兄意，散穀帛以周貧乏，鄉黨宗族以是重之。後乃博覽書記，該涉古今，往來京師，見者謂逖有贊世才具。僑居陽平。年二十四，陽平辟察孝廉，司隸再辟舉秀才，皆不行。與司空劉琨俱爲司州主簿，情好綢繆，共被同寢。中夜聞荒雞鳴，蹴琨覺曰：「此非惡聲也。」因起舞。逖、琨並有英氣，每語世事，或中宵起坐，相謂曰：「若四海鼎沸，豪傑並起，吾與足下當相避于中原耳。」","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-062-zuti:p001:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-062-zuti:p001:m0026"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"父武原任上谷太守。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-062-zuti:p001:m0026","surface":"武","start":26,"end":27,"person_id":"y5t_2r6_3d5","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-062-zuti:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-062-zuti"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-jin062-zuti-father","subject_person_id":"s8t_e95_gpz","object_person_id":"y5t_2r6_3d5","p